    {
      "source": "Creates a <code>DBRef</code> instance for the given <a href=\"../mapping/DBRef.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>DBRef</code></a>\nannotation, <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> and id.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"../mapping/DBRef.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>DBRef</code></a> 注解、<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> 和 id 创建一个 <code>DBRef</code> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Actually loads the <code>DBRef</code> from the datasource.",
      "translation": "实际上从数据源加载<code>DBRef</code>。",
      "count": 2
